Kanki Warp — a personal WARP client for Android.

It loads, unmodified, libraries built from:
  * Aether (Rust WARP / MASQUE core) by CluvexStudio — https://github.com/CluvexStudio/Aether (AGPL-3.0)
  * hev-socks5-tunnel by heiher — https://github.com/heiher/hev-socks5-tunnel (MIT)
The connection flow (stages, transport fallback, the real-traffic check) follows the design of
RIX-AETHER by REZA-RIX — https://github.com/RIX-REZA/RIX-AETHER (AGPL-3.0). The code here is our own.

